<feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><title>Deutsche Welle: DW.com</title><subtitle type="html">Deutsche Welle: DW.com</subtitle><id>https://rss.dw.com/xml/rss-en-asia</id><updated>2026-11-10T16:30:59Z</updated><author><name>rssync</name></author><link rel="self" href="rss-en-asia" type="application/atom+xml" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://www.dw.com/s-12758?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><link rel="via" href="https://rss.dw.com/xml/rss-en-asia" type="application/rss+xml" /><entry><title>Megaspeed and the battle to go high-end Nvidia chips into China</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:67a282a6c876382ac014fc4bb5de449ee3b62b5d644c064c7a484fe75f4bd809</id><updated>2026-11-10T16:30:14Z</updated><published>2026-11-10T14:32:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/megaspeed-and-the-battle-to-go-high-end-nvidia-chips-into-china/a-79909129--5e400fbb45fc.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/megaspeed-and-the-battle-to-go-high-end-nvidia-chips-into-china/a-79909129?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Jensen Huang's affair with a suspected Chinese spy has shone a light on Megaspeed, the company she worked for. It is under investigation in the US for smuggling Nvidia chips into China, which it denies.</summary><category term="Business" /></entry><entry><title>Japan watches for signs of change in Trump's foreign policy priorities</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:54c364d4d8b8341a3a462e678b0ab6e79691d0d9d7318364bd960445c0a788ae</id><updated>2026-11-10T16:30:20Z</updated><published>2026-11-10T13:31:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/japan-watches-for-signs-of-change-in-trump-s-foreign-policy-priorities/a-79909398--c0dcb3ef3493.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/japan-watches-for-signs-of-change-in-trump-s-foreign-policy-priorities/a-79909398?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Tokyo fears the drubbing US President Donald Trump suffered in last week's midterm election may push him to pursue a diplomatic quick win at the expense of Washington's allies in the Indo-Pacific.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>India: Sonia Gandhi's memoir 'Belonging: A Journey of Love' released</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:a07adf901d327ef31248cbbd1919d5f62b113fd9be225a2e8cdec8b9865a37a6</id><updated>2026-11-10T16:30:26Z</updated><published>2026-11-10T11:46:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/india-sonia-gandhi-s-memoir-belonging-a-journey-of-love-released/a-79908336--355cb9c7bbe4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/india-sonia-gandhi-s-memoir-belonging-a-journey-of-love-released/a-79908336?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The book goes through the Italian-born matriarch's journey with one of India's most politically influential families. It has already garnered political controversy, with the ruling BJP accusing her of "whitewashing."</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>India news: New Delhi ready to mediate Black Sea food corridors, says Ukraine's Zelenskyy</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:493010413b98016de27494eabba6e7bedd5d192563557d1efaefd20db929d6e2</id><updated>2026-11-10T16:29:38Z</updated><published>2026-11-10T06:52:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/india-news-new-delhi-ready-to-mediate-black-sea-food-corridors-says-ukraine-s-zelenskyy/live-79906023--cfcf53dfd0a6.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/india-news-new-delhi-ready-to-mediate-black-sea-food-corridors-says-ukraine-s-zelenskyy/live-79906023?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Ukraine's President Volodymyr Zelenskyy said he discussed establishing "food corridors" in the Black Sea in a phone call with Indian Prime Minister Narendra Modi.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Nvidia shareholders sue Jensen Huang over alleged spy ties</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:ad8effaba1aabb1eda8abfe750cb9fe3ef11c659cc2025ac4a00cf5cf664ea35</id><updated>2026-11-10T16:29:38Z</updated><published>2026-11-09T23:55:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/nvidia-shareholders-sue-jensen-huang-over-alleged-spy-ties/a-79905809--f4200acf2967.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/nvidia-shareholders-sue-jensen-huang-over-alleged-spy-ties/a-79905809?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Nvidia shareholders have sued the chipmaker and its CEO, Jensen Huang, over his alleged ties to a suspected Chinese spy. The case adds to scrutiny over whether sensitive information at the AI giant was compromised.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>India's demonetization: 10 years on, economic benefits still disputed</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:9dce68e99ebf9ea713ab693a8b88ea43d2a1b4e67651b0a14c66447fc41b5226</id><updated>2026-11-10T16:30:59Z</updated><published>2026-11-09T16:21:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/india-s-demonetization-10-years-on-economic-benefits-still-disputed/a-79903331--2fc450e61f09.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/india-s-demonetization-10-years-on-economic-benefits-still-disputed/a-79903331?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A decade after the 2016 currency ban, its impact on India's economy and the fight against black money remains contested.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>India news:  Delhi air quality level 'severe' after Diwali</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:4a4a4807abddf8db1ba3d46aa0c1fc4df1b18ab22ff88a68881f6c7ac4c69bf5</id><updated>2026-11-10T16:29:38Z</updated><published>2026-11-09T07:12:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/india-news-delhi-air-quality-level-severe-after-diwali/live-79895307--1403e23bf012.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/india-news-delhi-air-quality-level-severe-after-diwali/live-79895307?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Illegal fireworks during Diwali celebrations have impacted New Delhi's air quality level. DW has the latest.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Nvidia CEO Huang admits affair amid rumors of China spy ties</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:d2c408ba8f7cefcdd99f55a8175b85d8b376f7923d5a1b8d7bfc2580410490ec</id><updated>2026-11-10T16:29:38Z</updated><published>2026-11-08T23:07:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/nvidia-ceo-huang-admits-affair-amid-rumors-of-china-spy-ties/a-79894747--d2ac9a59ebd3.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/nvidia-ceo-huang-admits-affair-amid-rumors-of-china-spy-ties/a-79894747?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Following reports of Nvidia's chief Jensen Huang becoming involved with a Chinese spy, Huang offered an apology for cheating on his wife. Meanwhile, the US tech company pledged to investigate the alleged espionage.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>'No choice but to bear it': Delhi's unrelenting air pollution crisis</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:13585655ca57fd0a73bc41af6a3cb21b46e7bd0376c12a288b6df7fbb5a73b2c</id><updated>2026-11-10T16:29:38Z</updated><published>2026-11-06T12:05:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/no-choice-but-to-bear-it-delhi-s-unrelenting-air-pollution-crisis/a-79873124--aa42da1e16d2.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/no-choice-but-to-bear-it-delhi-s-unrelenting-air-pollution-crisis/a-79873124?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Despite years of government interventions, emergency restrictions and public outrage, Delhi continues to battle dangerously polluted air every winter. Why isn't there a lasting solution to a predictable crisis?</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>South Korea tests Arctic shipping route amid Russia-West row</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:1e02cc59e70ebebd98bbea286f5220e6bfcd25278e40bf5bf3d48cc22e763eda</id><updated>2026-11-10T16:29:38Z</updated><published>2026-11-05T09:45:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/south-korea-tests-arctic-shipping-route-amid-russia-west-row/a-79853907--d831b46c670a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/south-korea-tests-arctic-shipping-route-amid-russia-west-row/a-79853907?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">For South Korean ships, navigating off the north coast of Russia dramatically reduces travel time to Europe, but the pro-Ukraine coalition might see it as undermining their efforts to isolate Moscow.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>8 ways the US midterm election could affect Donald Trump's Iran policy</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:a32e88a8b9031df3fcd76a56a87501df645c286f38c6d0c75aa425b089fa4bb4</id><updated>2026-11-10T16:29:38Z</updated><published>2026-11-02T15:41:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/8-ways-the-us-midterm-election-could-affect-donald-trump-s-iran-policy/a-79831816--8cf7f9243f7e.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/8-ways-the-us-midterm-election-could-affect-donald-trump-s-iran-policy/a-79831816?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">While the US midterms could open a window for diplomacy with Iran, they could also unleash a new military escalation. DW spoke with analysts to identify eight factors that could tip the balance toward war or peace.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Bollywood and the underworld — together in the spotlight?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:02c897b1188dc56aa7635610b875c9a6ec585de865ac3bece95dbfaf201a41db</id><updated>2026-11-10T16:29:38Z</updated><published>2026-10-31T07:26:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/bollywood-and-the-underworld-together-in-the-spotlight/a-79806129--e6b957cc58ac.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/bollywood-and-the-underworld-together-in-the-spotlight/a-79806129?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A wave of shootings and extortion threats has rattled India's film industry. This time, those claiming responsibility are very different from the Mumbai underworld that had Bollywood in its grip back in the 1990s.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Is Iran headed to war or peace after Mecca alliance meeting?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:7a3279be22e5c6655d8f26cb67f0f70830893102ef42aad04dae0645476771f4</id><updated>2026-11-10T16:29:38Z</updated><published>2026-10-28T14:20:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/is-iran-headed-to-war-or-peace-after-mecca-alliance-meeting/a-79788256--9ef674df50a4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/is-iran-headed-to-war-or-peace-after-mecca-alliance-meeting/a-79788256?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Saudi Arabia, Pakistan and Turkey have taken their latest peace push directly to Tehran. Officially, it was to avert a new military escalation, but their diplomatic outreach can also be seen as a warning to Iran.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Will elections in Israel change its Iran approach?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:8e62592511b46894eb26c331111da9f059d08e18d792f188df6932faa2edbf0f</id><updated>2026-11-10T16:29:38Z</updated><published>2026-10-27T13:31:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/will-elections-in-israel-change-its-iran-approach/a-79776122--d46c291154a3.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/will-elections-in-israel-change-its-iran-approach/a-79776122?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">As Israelis head to the polls, the country's conflict with Iran casts a long shadow over the ballot box. But any leadership changes in Israel may not be enough to shake up its grand strategy on Tehran.</summary><category term="World" /></entry></feed>
